# Edge of the mangled-name limit (#724): a class of 976 characters with a
# method Function() without parameters (the refused long-ident-mangled has
# Function(Param:int)). OpenVerse prints
#   field 42 | method 1
# If Epic refuses it, the parameters are not what makes the mangled name too
# long. Run it alone (single mode).
Class2__ := class:
    V:int = 42
    Function():int = 1

Main():void =
    Obj := Class2__{}
    Print("OVPROBE field {Obj.V}")
    Print("OVPROBE method {Obj.Function()}")
